; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M2: Step trailing (TrailMode 4), setup 2 of 2: sell, session 1200-2000 server time, trend filter M30 EMA 50, target 1.5R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: every 1.5R of profit lifts the stop by 1.5R, one step behind (breakeven at +1.5R). Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 4, TrailParam 0). Its trailing starts at or beyond its 1.5R target, so the stop never moves before the target: this setup's result comes from its stop, target and time exits.
; Picked on 1 Jan 2025 - 15 May 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (FTMO spread, no commission; score 1.36): 113 trades, PF 1.54. Replay of the same months: 117 trades, PF 1.52.
; TICK REPLAY (every Dukascopy tick, the EA's rules; VT costs: VT's 0.15 spread scaled by Dukascopy's own spread, 0.60 USD commission per ounce). 16 May - 13 Nov 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 54 trades, PF 0.85, net -5.0R (stressed PF 0.83); the 2 setups of M2 + Step together 105 trades, PF 1.06, net +4.1R (stressed 0.98).
; Step trailing with its own setups was chosen as the best on M2 (highest PF of the EA's trailing systems with 100+ trades in those months; each system has its own setups), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 33 trades, PF 0.92. The 2 setups together: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 70 trades, PF 0.76. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Needs a spread near VT's 0.15 USD: at Dukascopy's own wider spreads the 2 setups took 81 of the 105 trades in those months, PF 1.12.
; Data: Dukascopy XAUUSD ticks, broker server time. Commission is in the figures: set CommissionPerLot to your round-trip commission per lot.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
